      "description": "One launcher_summary row per received attempt. outcome is succeeded | failed | cancelled | unknown; unknown means the launcher lost sight of the attempt (a crash, or a state it had to reconcile). For a launch, succeeded means the observed game process exited with code 0; it is never login or world entry. A failure before admission (phase platform_check, compatibility_check, catalog_fetch, manifest_verify, destination_check or admission) is counted as one failed row and stands for retry_count + 1 identical failed commands. Opted-in, received attempts only: the split is not a success rate.",
      "fillSpans": false,
      "id": "attempts-by-version-os-outcome",
      "nullZeroValues": "zero",
      "opacity": "1",
      "panelTypes": "table",
      "query": {
        "builder": {
          "queryData": [
            {
              "aggregations": [
                {
                  "expression": "count()"
                }
              ],
              "dataSource": "logs",
              "disabled": false,
              "expression": "A",
              "filter": {
                "expression": "service.name = 'cimmeria-client' AND scope_name = 'launcher.summary' AND event = 'launcher_summary'"
              },
              "functions": [],
              "groupBy": [
