      "description": "Failed attempts only. phase is where the attempt ended. none: the end was reported by a later launcher process, so no phase and no timing was observed. A check before admission (platform_check, compatibility_check, catalog_fetch, manifest_verify, destination_check, admission): the command was never admitted; the row has no duration, stands for retry_count + 1 identical failed commands and is counted once. admission with local_io or state_invalid means before or at admission. Otherwise the last timed phase entered (starting, running, download, extraction); launch_not_started can appear with phase = running. error_code is a closed set; unspecified means the launcher had no more specific code. retry_count is an at-least-once approximation: a retried request repeats it.",
      "fillSpans": false,
      "id": "failures-by-operation-phase-error",
      "nullZeroValues": "zero",
