      "description": "One launcher_phase row per timed phase of an attempt the launcher watched from admission. The count is the sample size of each bucket: lt_1s | lt_10s | lt_1m | lt_5m | lt_30m | ge_30m. Attempts reported after a launcher restart carry no phase timings, so they are absent here. Install: download and extraction each accumulate across the seed and every patch, and extraction also includes content verification and promotion after the last unpack. Launch: only the starting (preparation) phase is timed; there is no running row, because it would be the length of the play session. The last timed phase of a failed or cancelled attempt is included and ends at the failure. An unknown attempt (lost observation) has no timing for the phase that was open.",
